# Patterns are relative to the REPO ROOT: that is the build context (see Dockerfile).
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over <context>/.dockerignore, which
# makes THIS the file it reads when the context is the repo root. Keep it identical
# to the sibling .dockerignore.

.git
.github
.devcontainer
.vscode
docs
infra
certs

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/generated
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log

**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/.dockerignore
compose*.yml
Makefile
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
